  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.8.0 adds Web API v2.16.2 category options and v2.17.0 features while preserving compatibility with older servers.\n\n\t\t\t- Adds an explicit .NET 11 target alongside .NET 8, 9, and 10.\n\t\t\t- Adds metadata-fetch cancellation, torrent error details, and full search engine names (Web API v2.17.0).\n\t\t\t- Adds category share limits, optional category save-path updates, and tag/tracker removal confirmation preferences (Web API v2.16.2).\n\t\t\t- Fixes search result status deserialization without changing the existing public status type.\n\t\t\t- Preserves original five-parameter category method signatures, positional cancellation tokens, and legacy request behavior.\n\t\t\t- Streams torrent-list and sync JSON responses while preserving legacy response and encoding handling.\n\t\t\t- Validates .NET 8, 9, 10, and 11 with the shared contract suite and NativeAOT smoke application.\n\t\t\t- Expands old-server contract coverage and validates NativeAOT serialization with simulated responses.",
